  abilityName: One Last Breath
  abilityDesc: 15 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to HP lost), probable
    1 turn Atk, Def reduction infliction, boosts Atk, Def relative to max HP for
    3 turns, boosts damage against status afflicted foes for 3 turns & probable Injury,
    Weakness, Sickness, Paralysis infliction
